(7797671, 1300341, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Unusual crop, but well seen. Subsequent revisits have caused me to see interpretive layers in this framing. It hints at parallel realities, registers something like an interrogation of the tidy boxes we like to put ourselves in--the way we live in interdependent community but pretend like we''re living in isolation.
<br/>
<br/>Maybe that''s more than was intended, but good art is evocative like that, right?</td>', 'Unusual crop, but well seen. Subsequent revisits have caused me to see interpretive layers in this framing. It hints at parallel realities, registers something like an interrogation of the tidy boxes we like to put ourselves in--the way we live in interdependent community but pretend like we''re living in isolation.

Maybe that''s more than was intended, but good art is evocative like that, right?', '2025-10-14 14:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
